  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TextoIdioma
  en: "The Ta\xE7a das Favelas, affectionately known as \"Favel\xE3o\", has been organized by the Central \xDAnica das Favelas (CUFA) since 2011 and has established itself as the largest football tournament between favelas in the world. In women's football, the championship plays a transformative role by creating space and visibility for young athletes from the urban peripheries, using sport as a powerful tool for social inclusion, talent discovery and the affirmation of identity for peripheral communities across the country."
